   "wasmRuntime": "Mono 9.0.22 interpreter (Microsoft.NETCore.App.Runtime.Mono.wasi-wasm 9.0.22) via the wasi-experimental workload",
   "wasmToolchain": "wasi-sdk 24 (clang 18.1.2), target rewritten to wasm32-wasip1, WasmSingleFileBundle, no AOT",
